        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jackson_Township%2C_New_Jersey"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1974, Six Flags Great Adventure opened, turning Jackson into a major regional amusement destination.",
