      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jackson_Township%2C_New_Jersey"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A portion of Jackson lies within the Pinelands National Reserve, preserving its unique coastal plain ecosystem.",
